  "content": "Cynthia Kaiser, SVP of Halcyon's Ransomware Research Center, tells Dark Reading that Halcyon identified the legal sector as the fourth most targeted industry by ransomware actors in the first months of 2026. \"Law firms are an attractive target due to the sensitivity of client data, regulatory pressure to resolve incidents quickly, and a perceived willingness to pay ransoms to protect attorney-client privilege and confidential case materials,\" she says.",
